ja:
このスピンを、他のすべてと熱平衡にある小さな部分系として扱う。その分配関数は $\begin{aligned}z
&=\sum_{\sigma=\pm1}e^{-\beta E(\sigma)}
 =\sum_{\sigma=\pm1}e^{\beta J\sigma} \\
&=e^{\beta J}+e^{-\beta J}
 =2\cosh(\beta J).\end{aligned}$

zh:
把这个自旋看作与其余一切处于热平衡的小子系统。其配分函数为 $\begin{aligned}z
&=\sum_{\sigma=\pm1}e^{-\beta E(\sigma)}
 =\sum_{\sigma=\pm1}e^{\beta J\sigma} \\
&=e^{\beta J}+e^{-\beta J}
 =2\cosh(\beta J).\end{aligned}$

p.src:
The same result could be embedded in a collection of $N$ independent spins. The full partition function would simply be $Z=z^N$, so $\log Z=N\log z$ and every extensive thermodynamic quantity would be $N$ times its one-spin value. This subsystem viewpoint replaces the longer combinatorial count of how many spins point up and down, but it contains the same information. The average energy follows from the logarithmic derivative: $\begin{aligned}\expect{E}
&=-\frac{\partial}{\partial\beta}\log z \\
&=-J\frac{\sinh(\beta J)}{\cosh(\beta J)}
 =-J\tanh(\beta J).\end{aligned}$ Since $E=-J\sigma$, $\expect{\sigma}=\tanh(\beta J).$

